Package: TargetCNVML
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Ground-Truth Validation, Supervised Classification, and Copy-Number Inference for Target-Capture Data
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Diego Andres",
    family = "Benitez Duarte",
    email = "dabenitezd@unal.edu.co",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = "Maestria en Bioinformatica, Universidad Nacional de Colombia"
  )
Description: Modular R toolkit and command-line pipeline for copy-number variation (CNV)
  estimation from target-capture assemblies produced by CAPTUS. Implements spatial
  coordinate intersection against chromosome-scale or contig-scale reference genomes,
  supervised classifier benchmarking with deterministic cross-validation, multi-model
  consensus voting, orthogroup-level copy-number concordance metrics, and cross-species
  phylogenetic transferability evaluation.
